msgid "Active payment methods this (provider, kind) can settle, by the same rules checkout applies when the shopper picks it. Stated as a fact per option rather than as 'exclusive to this row': the storefront collapses several carriers into one home-delivery card, so only it knows which rows it actually renders and can work out what a given choice uniquely unlocks. Lets the delivery step advertise a carrier-only product — BOX NOW Αντικαταβολή is reachable ONLY via a BoxNow locker, and a shopper who never picks one has no way to discover it exists."
